stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> restoring
    restoring --> authenticated: sesion valida guardada
    restoring --> expired: sesion guardada vencida
    restoring --> unauthenticated: sin token o error de almacenamiento
    unauthenticated --> authenticated: signIn correcto y token guardado
    unauthenticated --> unauthenticated: signIn rechazado o error de red
    authenticated --> expired: expiracion
    authenticated --> unauthenticated: signOut
    expired --> unauthenticated: refreshFailed
    expired --> unauthenticated: signOut
